<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31319" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εισγράφω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inscribe,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηλῶν ἐς α&lt;&gt;ς οἱ νόμοι
				ἐσεγράφοντο</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				37.9
			</span></i>; <i>enrol,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ εἰς τοὺς φίλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					36.53
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς ἐς τὸν κατάλογον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					109.5
				</span></i>
			 ; also of painting, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορφυραῖ σκιαὶ τοὺς ὀφθαλμοὺς εἰς
					κάλλοσ-ουσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					12.25
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰς σπονδὰς ἐσγράψασθαι
				ἑαυτούς</span>
			<i>to have</i> themselves <i>enrolled</i> in the league, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.31
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				61.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> simply,
				<i>write down,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαντεῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1167
				</span></i>
			; <i>send in a report</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				46.400
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Mylasa</span>).</div>
